id: si91x_diag
label: SL Diagnostic SiWx91x Integration
package: platform_siwx91x
description: >
  SiWx91x platform integration for the SL Diagnostic (sl_diag) service.
  Latches the SiWx91x reset cause and publishes the watchdog bits of
  MCU_FSM_WAKEUP_STATUS_REG so sl_diag can classify a watchdog reset at boot.
  The device uptime comes from the weak sl_diag default, which reads the Sleep
  Timer when it is installed. Selected automatically when sl_diag is installed
  on a SiWx91x device.
category: Device|Si91x|MCU|Service
quality: evaluation
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
provides:
  - name: si91x_diag
requires:
  - name: sl_diag
  - name: component_catalog
define:
  - name: RESET_WDOG0
    value: 0x00000020UL
  - name: RESET_WDOG1
    value: 0x00000040UL
  - name: RESET_WDOG2
    value: 0x00000100UL
  - name: RESET_WDOG3
    value: 0x00000200UL
root_path: components/device/silabs/si91x/mcu/drivers/service/sl_diag
include:
  - path: inc
    file_list:
      - path: sli_si91x_diag.h
source:
  - path: src/sl_si91x_diag.c
